Pietro Beyer,"My name is [name]. I grauated with honoors from [location] [compaany], receiving both my Bachelor's and Master’s degrees in Applied Mathematics. I have a strong academic background in applied mathematics, machine learning, and data analysis, with a particular focus on medical applications, computer vision, and computational modeling.
